# 🔐 Cybersecurity Relevance

Process and service monitoring helps SOC analysts investigate:

* Unexpected processes
* High CPU usage
* High memory usage
* Unauthorized services
* Suspicious executables
* Persistence mechanisms
* Network-connected processes
* Compromised accounts

A basic investigation flow is:

```text
Suspicious Process
       ↓
Find PID
       ↓
Identify User
       ↓
Find Executable
       ↓
Check Parent Process
       ↓
Check Network Connections
       ↓
Check Logs
       ↓
Determine Whether Activity Is Expected
```

